37092>>>>>    
37092>>>>>    Function IsLoggedIn Returns Boolean
37094>>>>>        String sLoginName
37094>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession bLoggedIn
37094>>>>>        
37094>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37095>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37097>>>>>            Forward Get IsLoggedIn to bLoggedIn
37099>>>>>            Function_Return bLoggedIn
37100>>>>>        End
37100>>>>>>
37100>>>>>        
