37103>>>>>    
37103>>>>>    //
37103>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37103>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37103>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37103>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37103>>>>>    //
37103>>>>>    // Params:
37103>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37103>>>>>    //
37103>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37105>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37105>>>>>        
37105>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37106>>>>>        
37106>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37106>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37108>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37109>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37110>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37111>>>>>            
37111>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37112>>>>>        End
37112>>>>>>
37112>>>>>        Else Begin
37113>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37114>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37115>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37116>>>>>            
37116>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37117>>>>>        End
37117>>>>>>
37117>>>>>    End_Procedure
37118>>>>>    
37118>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37120>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37120>>>>>    End_Procedure
37121>>>>>    
37121>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37123>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37123>>>>>    End_Procedure
