37126>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37126>>>>>        
37126>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37127>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37128>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37130>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37132>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37133>>>>>        End
37133>>>>>>
37133>>>>>            
37133>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37133>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37134>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37135>>>>>        
37135>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37136>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37138>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37139>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
