37142>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37142>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37143>>>>>>
37143>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37144>>>>>            End
37144>>>>>>
37144>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37145>>>>>        End
37145>>>>>>
37145>>>>>    End_Procedure
